            "detailed_description": "<strong>Put on a lizard and go for an adventure!</strong><br><br>Choose your lizard carefully. You can find six different ones scattered across the land, each with its own special ability.<br><br>You'll need these abilities as you make your difficult journey through many dangerous places. Carefully hop your way to the top of an active volcano. Surf down a surging river. Swim an underwater lake. Ascend a snowy mountaintop. What kind of strange creatures will you meet? Can you unravel the mysteries of Lizard?<br><br><br>Lizard is an original game for the NES, presented here on various Steam supported platforms. If you're looking for the NES cartridge, please visit the website.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content advisory:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tricky platforming gameplay. There is an &quot;easy&quot; mode but many find it difficult.<br></li><li>Coin currency that is of dubious value.<br></li><li>Too small for details tiny pixelated nudity.<br></li><li>Spooky skeletons.<br></li><li>Strange concept of death that may not reflect reality.<br></li><li>An obscure tobacco reference?<br></li><li>A mug of coffee somewhere.<br></li><li>You'll get lost.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Put on a lizard and go for an adventure!</strong><br><br>Choose your lizard carefully. You can find six different ones scattered across the land, each with its own special ability.<br><br>You'll need these abilities as you make your difficult journey through many dangerous places. Carefully hop your way to the top of an active volcano. Surf down a surging river. Swim an underwater lake. Ascend a snowy mountaintop. What kind of strange creatures will you meet? Can you unravel the mysteries of Lizard?<br><br><br>Lizard is an original game for the NES, presented here on various Steam supported platforms. If you're looking for the NES cartridge, please visit the website.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content advisory:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tricky platforming gameplay. There is an &quot;easy&quot; mode but many find it difficult.<br></li><li>Coin currency that is of dubious value.<br></li><li>Too small for details tiny pixelated nudity.<br></li><li>Spooky skeletons.<br></li><li>Strange concept of death that may not reflect reality.<br></li><li>An obscure tobacco reference?<br></li><li>A mug of coffee somewhere.<br></li><li>You'll get lost.</li></ul>",
