                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Describing this game as mindless exploration might sound like an insult, but the way it's done is actually pretty fun. There's no real goal, but there's tight platforming and fun side stuff/secrets. While playing on original hardware is not a bad option either, the password system is half and half. It keeps track of what lizard you had and which area you were in, doesn't keep track what bosses you beat or what coins you got. Thankfully the PC version saves all your progress.",
